ite 1 single clause of 4-8 words that ONLY reflects the user's Japanese scenario>\",\n  \"audio_ja\": \"<Japanese translation of the English line>\",\n  \"video_prompt\": \"<English visual description of Queen Lilith's expression and reaction matching the scenario>\",\n  \"video_prompt_ja\": \"<Japanese translation of the video prompt>\"\n}",
